{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live the life...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small-time criminal with nothing but ambition. From <strong>drug</strong> <strong>deals</strong> to daring <strong>heists</strong>, build your reputation, expand your gang\u2019s operations, and take control of the city while battling rival gangs and staying ahead of the law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/b5b9e33c2114d2ede67f31b796eec097.poster.avif?t=1768496535\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/b5b9e33c2114d2ede67f31b796eec097.webm?t=1768496535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/b5b9e33c2114d2ede67f31b796eec097.mp4?t=1768496535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a city full of NPCs and enterable buildings.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your gang...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different weapons to complete the jobs you are given. Some jobs require range, some require getting your hands dirty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/970d4cc156b1f540baa75b84e6bacac2.poster.avif?t=1768496535\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/970d4cc156b1f540baa75b84e6bacac2.webm?t=1768496535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many different combat situations and areas to play.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Life...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your reputation by selling and manufacturing a <strong>variety of drugs</strong>. When rival gangs move in on your product, do whatever it takes to get it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/b266b85850d1a15dc603836bc9c45ba7.poster.avif?t=1768496535\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/b266b85850d1a15dc603836bc9c45ba7.webm?t=1768496535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/b266b85850d1a15dc603836bc9c45ba7.mp4?t=1768496535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress through <strong>story missions</strong> and <strong>side quests</strong> as you carve your path from small-time thug to city kingpin.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is your city, day and night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete deals, jobs, and missions set in the day or the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/d41f5b53a491d0f1e4f87d7504e75596.poster.avif?t=1768496535\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/d41f5b53a491d0f1e4f87d7504e75596.webm?t=1768496535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/d41f5b53a491d0f1e4f87d7504e75596.mp4?t=1768496535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061040?t=1768496535","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/6a47f2c94e5d8b06b3daf9dc3d27d6bc2e9d8781/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768496535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/7d65ab20d02cbe59cb34a98e6725ade3039cdfc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768496535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/7d65ab20d02cbe59cb34a98e6725ade3039cdfc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768496535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game's violence is in a cartoonish, unrealistic style. "},"demos":[{"appid":4066740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live the life...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small-time criminal with nothing but ambition. From <strong>drug</strong> <strong>deals</strong> to daring <strong>heists</strong>, build your reputation, expand your gang\u2019s operations, and take control of the city while battling rival gangs and staying ahead of the law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/b5b9e33c2114d2ede67f31b796eec097.poster.avif?t=1768496535\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extras/b5b9e33c2114d2ede67f31b796eec097.webm?t=1768496535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061040/extr